ass=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">γ</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> w}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <span class=\"fn\">α</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">α</span> → <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a>) → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">a</span>.<a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.size\">size</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> → <span class=\"fn\">γ</span></span></span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Program.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.InPlace.Tail\">Tail</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">γ</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Ends the program with the result `x`: hands `x`, the array and its size to `k`.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/ISize/Program.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.InPlace.Tail.done","kind":"def","line":891,"name":"ScalarArray.ISizeArray.InPlace.Tail.done","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/ef15f198ef3e5fefe3f9b45b89a25772f75b1809/ScalarArray/ISize/Program.lean#L891-L894"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">structure</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Program.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.InPlace.Tail\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">ISizeArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">InPlace</span>.<span class=\"name\