LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">hi</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">init</span> : <span class=\"fn\">β</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">body</span> : <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">j</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>) → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">lo</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">j</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">j</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">hi</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">β</span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Program.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.InPlace\">InPlace</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">β</span></span></span></span></span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Program.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.InPlace\">InPlace</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">β</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Runs `body j hlo hj b` for each `j` from `j₀ - 1` down to `lo`, threading the accumulator `b`\nfrom `init`. `forInRev` is the case `j₀ = hi`. It is specified by `forInRevFrom_eq`.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/ISize/Program.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.InPlace.forInRevFrom","kind":"def","line":276,"name":"ScalarArray.ISizeArray.InPlace.forInRevFrom","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/ef15