\"><span class=\"fn\">lo</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">j</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span>).<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The index of a step of `forIn`: `lo ≤ j + 1` when `lo ≤ j < hi`.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/ISize/Program.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.InPlace.forIn_le_succ","kind":"theorem","line":178,"name":"ScalarArray.ISizeArray.InPlace.forIn_le_succ","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/ef15f198ef3e5fefe3f9b45b89a25772f75b1809/ScalarArray/ISize/Program.lean#L178-L181"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Program.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.InPlace.run\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">ISizeArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">InPlace</span>.<span class=\"name\">run</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Program.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.InPlace\">InPlace</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a</span> : <a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Basic.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray\">ISizeArray</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">h</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span cl