=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">t</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">c</span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Program.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.InPlace\">InPlace</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Not\">¬</a><span class=\"fn\">c</span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Program.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.InPlace\">InPlace</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Program.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.InPlace\">InPlace</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`InPlace.ite` where each branch takes the proof of its condition.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/ISize/Program.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.InPlace.dite","kind":"def","line":161,"name":"ScalarArray.ISizeArray.InPlace.dite","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/ef15f198ef3e5fefe3f9b45b89a25772f75b1809/ScalarArray/ISize/Program.lean#L161-L165"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Program.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.InPlace.ite\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">ISizeArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">InPlace</span>.<span class=\"name\">ite</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Prop</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Decidable\">Decidable</a> <span class=\"fn\">c</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">t </span><span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Program.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.InPlace\">InPlace</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Program.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.InPlace\">InPlace</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Runs `t` if `c` holds and `e` otherwise. Unlike `if c then t else e`, which chooses a program and\nthen runs it, it compiles to a branch inside one program, without building the programs of the two\nbranches as closures.","docLink":"./ScalarArray/ISize/Program.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.InPlace.ite","kind":"def","line":152,"name":"ScalarArray.ISizeArray.InPlace.ite","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-scalar-arrays/blob/ef15f198ef3e5fefe3f9b45b89a25772f75b1809/ScalarArray/ISize/Program.lean#L152-L159"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./ScalarArray/ISize/Program.html#ScalarArray.ISizeArray.InPlace.writeThen\"><span class=\"name\">ScalarArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">ISizeArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">InPlace</span>.<span class=\"name\">writeThen</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=